SCHEDULE V

COLLECTION OF PERSONAL DATA

1.where the personal data relating to a data subject is collectedfrom the data subject, the controller shall provide the data subjectwith the following information, at the time of collection of suchpersonal data -

(a)the identity and contact details of the controller and whereapplicable of the controller’s representative;

(b)the contact details of the Data Protection Officer, whereapplicable;

