3.Items 1, and 2 of this Schedule shall not apply where the datasubject already has obtained or made aware of the information.

4.Where the personal data of the data subject has been obtainedother than through a direct interaction with the data subject, thecontroller shall provide the data subject, the source from which thepersonal data originate, and whether or not it came from publiclyaccessible source, where applicable in addition to the informationrequired under item 1 of this schedule.

